#: authentik/core/models.py
msgid ""
"Link to a user with identical email address. Can have security implications "
"when a source doesn't validate email addresses."
msgstr ""
"Tilknyt en bruger med samme e-mailadresse. Kan have sikkerhedsmæssige "
"konsekvenser, når en kilde ikke validerer e-mailadresser."

#: authentik/core/models.py
msgid ""
"Use the user's email address, but deny enrollment when the email address "
"already exists."
msgstr ""
"Brug brugerens e-mailadresse, men afvis registrering, hvis e-mailadressen "
"allerede findes."

#: authentik/core/models.py
msgid ""
"Link to a user with identical username. Can have security implications when "
"a username is used with another source."
msgstr ""
"Sammenkæd med en bruger med identisk brugernavn. Kan have sikkerhedsmæssige "
"konsekvenser, når et brugernavn bruges sammen med en anden kilde."

#: authentik/core/models.py
msgid ""
"Use the user's username, but deny enrollment when the username already "
